'''Cave snakes''' are found in resource rooms within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. They can appear in [[Bubbles|fishing spots]] and attack the player and anyone adjacent to it.
If players have cooked fish in their inventory, it will steal one when attacking. When this occurs, a message will appear in the chatbox stating: {{Mes|The snake stole some food off you!}}. The snake can deal 3-6 damage, even if not stealing food. Cave snakes will not steal raw fish.
[[File:Cave snake attacking.png|thumb|left|250px|A player is attacked by a cave snake.]]

== Trivia ==
* Attempting to fish while a cave snake is present will give the chat message {{Mes|This seems like a very bad moment to fish here.}}.

